## PROJECT CONTEXT (read-only)

The project has:
- `WorksheetRow` type is `Record<string, string>` — all values are strings from Tableau
- `available_days` is typed `float | None` on backend — frontend sends `number | null`
- `_INTERNAL_ACTIONS` handlers signature: `(params: dict, available_days: float | None) -> dict`
- `IntegrationError` propagates to global handler → 503 response
- `check_capacity` pure function — no I/O, no side effects
- `_resolve_integration(tool_name)` returns `(integration_name, action_string)` tuple
- The `messages` list at the point of internal action dispatch has: system prompt + masked conversation history + current masked user message + masked LLM assistant turn

